  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EMPOWERING COMMUNITIES, BUILDING RESILIENCE&apos;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve the lives of vulnerable communities residing in remote mountain areas of Nepal. It will enable targeted groups to increase their economic security through diversified livelihood strategies, including introducing better climate-smart agricultural practices. It will also seek to increase social inclusion and empowerment by supporting people with disabilities and establish community-based organisations to promote collective action and decision-making.</narrative>
  </description>
